      <description>&lt;h2&gt;OpenRamble 0.27.5&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Opening Dictation History no longer makes the Settings sidebar disappear.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The history stays inside the window, with its controls visible and its text&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;below the title bar. Switching sections and resizing the window work with&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;both an empty history and a long list of dictations.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
